WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.251 --> 00:00:03.795
Sing the song of the Seven Sandpiper.

00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:16.558
You’re nothing, you’re less. You’re broken, a mess. Defeated and hopeless, you’ll sink to the depths.

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:25.650
The oppressors are mighty, way greater in strength.
Let history warn you resistance means death.

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:34.409
Forget all they’ve told you, for history’s fine glow
is tarnished by those who don’t want you to know

00:00:34.409 --> 00:00:44.335
the power of your stories, your songs, and yourselves
to take back the land for the dwarves and the elves.

00:00:44.335 --> 00:00:52.677
So sing loud and proud, the Song of the Seven!
Be you halfling or gnome, be you dwarven or elven!

00:00:52.677 --> 00:01:02.729
You carry their stories, no oppressor can hide them!
Carry their glories and rise! We will rise!

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:10.653
Sing loud and proud, the Song of the Seven!
Be you halfling or gnome, be you dwarven or elven!

00:01:10.653 --> 00:01:22.916
You carry their stories, no oppressor can hide them!
Carry their glories and rise! We will rise!

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:30.131
Bonded in a blood quest, for vengeance and truth.
Destined to fail, but the Seven refused.

00:01:30.131 --> 00:01:38.264
Seven warriors apart, unite as one fist.
The empire would crush them, but they said fuck this!

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:40.517
THEY SAID FUCK THIS!

00:01:40.517 --> 00:01:48.566
They rallied the people, with brave deed and song.
Their courage has shown them the right from the wrong.

00:01:48.566 --> 00:01:58.409
The power of a story, put fire in their veins.
The people will rise up to bring forth a change.

